      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">In the natural terrain of your homelands, you are always aware when something magical stalks or ails it. When you Seek, your Magic Whiskers feature detects magic as if it were an imprecise sense, and you gain the benefits of a 3rd rank detect-magic spell. When you reach 13th level, these benefits are permanent.</span></p>"
